          "source_id": "q0",
          "quote": "Ratified interpretation, and the whole of this design: **every continuous parameter gets one\nobjective decimal resolution `10^-k` in its own native unit (the *base unit*), and its canonical\npersisted value is an INTEGER count `n` of that base unit.** The lattice stops being a set of\ngenerated geometric points and becomes the closed integer interval `[n_min, n_max]`."
